+ * A context is mutable and is not thread-safe. mpp_enc_roi_setup_meta()
+ * stores pointers owned by ctx in meta; keep that ctx alive and do not reuse
+ * it for another in-flight frame until the encoder has finished consuming the
+ * frame. Use one context per asynchronous input slot.
